---
// Filled from the newest ETH block in the first /api/chains.json response (BNB if ETH is
// unavailable), then frozen while the visitor reads. Without data it stays a "—" skeleton.
---
<section id="anatomy" class="wrap sec" aria-labelledby="anatomy-title" data-anatomy>
  <p class="k">// anatomy of a block</p>
  <h2 id="anatomy-title">One real block,<br />taken apart.</h2>
  <div class="anat">
    <div class="bcard">
      <p class="k" style="font-size:11px"><span data-a-chain>ethereum</span> · block</p>
      <p class="bnum" data-a-number>#—</p>
      <figure class="spec" data-a-spec hidden>
        <div class="spec-tile"><i></i></div>
        <figcaption data-a-speccap></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <dl>
        <div class="kv" data-row="1"><dt>hash</dt><dd data-a-hash>—</dd></div>
        <div class="kv" data-row="1"><dt>validator</dt><dd data-a-miner>—</dd></div>
        <div class="kv" data-row="1"><dt>time</dt><dd data-a-time>—</dd></div>
        <div class="kv" data-row="2"><dt>transactions</dt><dd data-a-tx>—</dd></div>
        <div class="kv" data-row="3"><dt>gas used</dt><dd data-a-gas>—</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="gas" aria-hidden="true"><div data-a-gasbar></div></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step" data-step="1"><span class="n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div>
          <h3>Header</h3>
          <p>Number, hash, parent, validator and time, exactly as the chain recorded them.</p>
          <a class="lnk" data-a-link="/blocks/" href="https://ethscan.io/blocks">ethscan.io/blocks ↗</a>
        </div></li>
        <li class="step" data-step="2"><span class="n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div>
          <h3 data-a-txh>Transactions</h3>
          <p>Each with its receipt, logs and status. The receipts are checked against the block before anything is written.</p>
          <a class="lnk" data-a-link="/txs" href="https://ethscan.io/txs">ethscan.io/txs ↗</a>
        </div></li>
        <li class="step" data-step="3"><span class="n" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div>
          <h3>Gas</h3>
          <p data-a-gasp>How full the block ran, and what it cost to get in.</p>
          <a class="lnk" data-a-link="/gas" href="https://ethscan.io/gas">ethscan.io/gas ↗</a>
        </div></li>
        <li class="step" data-step="4"><span class="n" aria-hidden="true">04</span><div>
          <h3>What Altscan derives</h3>
          <p>Token transfers, DEX trades, whale movements and webhooks, written from the receipts and safe to replay.</p>
          <a class="lnk" data-a-link="/dex" href="https://ethscan.io/dex">ethscan.io/dex ↗</a>
        </div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="also">Every explorer also has address pages with token and NFT holdings, token pages,
        <a data-a-link="/verify" href="https://ethscan.io/verify">contract verification</a> through Sourcify,
        <a data-a-link="/charts" href="https://ethscan.io/charts">network charts</a> and a
        <a data-a-link="/api-docs" href="https://ethscan.io/api-docs">REST API</a> with keys and webhooks.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
